        <div class="page-head">
          <h1 class="page-title">反馈</h1>
          <p class="page-subtitle">建议 / 投诉 / 申诉 · 3 类入口 · 7×24 受理</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 标签 -->
        <div class="tabs js-tabs" data-target="feedback-panels">
          <div class="tab is-active" data-tab="suggest">建议</div>
          <div class="tab" data-tab="complain">投诉</div>
          <div class="tab" data-tab="appeal">申诉</div>
          <div class="tab" data-tab="history">历史记录</div>
        </div>

        <div id="feedback-panels" class="tab-panels">
          <!-- 建议 -->
          <div class="tab-panel" data-panel="suggest">
            <div class="grid-2x" style="grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;">
              <div>
                <div class="card">
                  <div class="form-section">
                    <div class="form-section-title">建议类型</div>
                    <div class="segmented js-segmented" style="width: 100%;">
                      <div class="segmented-item is-active" style="flex: 1;">产品改进</div>
                      <div class="segmented-item" style="flex: 1;">功能建议</div>
                      <div class="segmented-item" style="flex: 1;">内容建议</div>
                      <div class="segmented-item" style="flex: 1;">其他</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="form-section">
                    <div class="form-section-title">建议标题</div>
                    <input class="input" placeholder="一句话描述您的建议" />
                  </div>
                  <div class="form-section">
                    <div class="form-section-title">详细描述</div>
                    <textarea class="textarea" rows="6" placeholder="请详细说明：1) 现状 2) 期望 3) 建议方案 4) 价值"></textarea>
                    <div class="input-hint mt-1">50-1000 字 · 已输入 0 / 1000</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="form-section">
                    <div class="form-section-title">关联模块</div>
                    <select class="select">
                      <option>工作台 / 推荐人</option>
                      <option>学习中心</option>
                      <option>客户管理</option>
                      <option>服务订单</option>
                      <option>公益项目</option>
                      <option>其他</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                  <div class="form-section">
                    <div class="form-section-title">附件</div>
                    <div class="border p-4" style="border-style: dashed; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); text-align: center;">
                      <div class="text-sm text-ink-3">点击或拖拽文件到此处</div>
                      <div class="text-xs text-ink-3 mt-1">支持 PNG / JPG / PDF · 单个 5MB 以内 · 最多 5 个</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="form-section" style="border-bottom: none;">
                    <div class="form-section-title">联系方式</div>
                    <div class="segmented js-segmented">
                      <div class="segmented-item is-active">App 通知</div>
                      <div class="segmented-item">邮件</div>
                      <div class="segmented-item">短信</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between mt-6">
                    <button class="btn btn-secondary">存草稿</button>
                    <div class="flex gap-2">
                      <button class="btn btn-ghost">取消</button>
                      <button class="btn btn-primary">提交建议</button>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="card">
                  <div class="fw-semibold mb-3">我的建议统计</div>
                  <div class="text-3xl text-display fw-semibold"><span class="js-counter" data-target="8">0</span></div>
                  <div class="text-xs text-ink-3 mt-1">已提交建议</div>
                  <div class="mt-4 pt-4" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);">
                    <div class="flex justify-between text-sm mb-1">
                      <span>已采纳</span><span class="fw-medium text-success">3</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between text-sm mb-1">
                      <span>处理中</span><span class="fw-medium text-warn">2</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between text-sm">
                      <span>已回复</span><span class="fw-medium">5</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card mt-4">
                  <div class="fw-semibold mb-3">采纳排行 · 季度</div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-1">· 1. 王明远 · 12 条</div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-1">· 2. 林秀华 · 8 条</div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-1">· 3. 陈丽华 · 6 条</div>
                  <div class="text-xs text-ink-3 mt-3">采纳可获 +5 PB</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 投诉 -->
          <div class="tab-panel" data-panel="complain" style="display: none;">
            <div class="card">
              <div class="form-section">
                <div class="form-section-title">投诉对象</div>
                <select class="select">
                  <option>EMP 顾问</option>
                  <option>AI 顾问</option>
                  <option>其他会员</option>
                  <option>客户服务</option>
                  <option>其他</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="form-section">
                <div class="form-section-title">投诉原因</div>
                <div class="grid-2x">
                  <label class="check-pill js-check-pill" style="display:flex; padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
                    <input type="radio" name="reason" style="margin-right: var(--space-2);" />
                    <span class="text-sm">服务质量</span>
                  </label>
                  <label class="check-pill js-check-pill" style="display:flex; padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
                    <input type="radio" name="reason" style="margin-right: var(--space-2);" />
                    <span class="text-sm">态度问题</span>
                  </label>
                  <label class="check-pill js-check-pill" style="display:flex; padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
                    <input type="radio" name="reason" style="margin-right: var(--space-2);" />
                    <span class="text-sm">专业度</span>
                  </label>
                  <label class="check-pill js-check-pill" style="display:flex; padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
                    <input type="radio" name="reason" style="margin-right: var(--space-2);" />
                    <span class="text-sm">违规行为</span>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="form-section">
                <div class="form-section-title">投诉详情</div>
                <textarea class="textarea" rows="6" placeholder="请描述事件经过、涉及时间、关键证据"></textarea>
              </div>
              <div class="form-section">
                <div class="form-section-title">证据</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-ink-2">请提供：1) 时间 2) 涉及人 3) 截图/录音 4) 其他证据</div>
                <div class="border mt-3 p-4" style="border-style: dashed; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); text-align: center;">
                  <div class="text-sm text-ink-3">点击或拖拽文件到此处</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="form-section" style="border-bottom: none;">
                <div class="form-section-title">期望处理</div>
                <div class="grid-3x">
                  <label class="check-pill js-check-pill" style="display:flex; padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
                    <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: var(--space-2);" />
                    <span class="text-sm">道歉</span>
                  </label>
                  <label class="check-pill js-check-pill" style="display:flex; padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
                    <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: var(--space-2);" />
                    <span class="text-sm">退款</span>
                  </label>
                  <label class="check-pill js-check-pill" style="display:flex; padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
                    <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: var(--space-2);" />
                    <span class="text-sm">更换顾问</span>
                  </label>
                  <label class="check-pill js-check-pill" style="display:flex; padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
                    <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: var(--space-2);" />
                    <span class="text-sm">暂停服务</span>
                  </label>
                  <label class="check-pill js-check-pill" style="display:flex; padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
                    <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: var(--space-2);" />
                    <span class="text-sm">其他</span>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between mt-6">
                <button class="btn btn-secondary">存草稿</button>
                <div class="flex gap-2">
                  <button class="btn btn-ghost">取消</button>
                  <button class="btn btn-danger">提交投诉</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 申诉 -->
          <div class="tab-panel" data-panel="appeal" style="display: none;">
            <div class="card">
              <div class="alert p-4 mb-4" style="background: var(--color-warn-soft); border-radius: var(--radius-md);">
                <div class="text-sm fw-medium" style="color: var(--color-warn-2);">⚠ 申诉须知</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-ink-2 mt-1">申诉适用于：账号被封 / PB 评分争议 / 客户评级争议 / 公益资金使用争议。申诉处理周期 7-14 个工作日。</div>
              </div>
              <div class="form-section">
                <div class="form-section-title">申诉类型</div>
                <select class="select">
                  <option>账号封禁申诉</option>
                  <option>PB 评分争议</option>
                  <option>客户评级争议</option>
                  <option>公益资金使用争议</option>
                  <option>其他</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="form-section">
                <div class="form-section-title">原决定编号</div>
                <input class="input" placeholder="原决定邮件 / 通知中的编号" />
              </div>
              <div class="form-section">
                <div class="form-section-title">申诉理由</div>
                <textarea class="textarea" rows="8" placeholder="请详细说明：1) 原决定 2) 您认为的问题 3) 证据 4) 期望处理"></textarea>
              </div>
              <div class="form-section">
                <div class="form-section-title">证据清单</div>
                <div class="border p-4" style="border-style: dashed; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); text-align: center;">
                  <div class="text-sm text-ink-3">上传证据 · 多个文件</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="form-section" style="border-bottom: none;">
                <div class="form-section-title">真实性声明</div>
                <label class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <input type="checkbox" style="margin-top: 4px;" />
                  <span class="text-sm">本人保证所提交内容真实有效 · 如有虚假愿承担法律责任</span>
                </label>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between mt-6">
                <button class="btn btn-secondary">存草稿</button>
                <div class="flex gap-2">
                  <button class="btn btn-ghost">取消</button>
                  <button class="btn btn-primary">提交申诉</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 历史 -->
          <div class="tab-panel" data-panel="history" style="display: none;">
            <div class="filter-bar">
              <div class="filter-chip is-active js-filter">全部 <span class="filter-chip-count">8</span></div>
              <div class="filter-chip js-filter">建议 <span class="filter-chip-count">3</span></div>
              <div class="filter-chip js-filter">投诉 <span class="filter-chip-count">2</span></div>
              <div class="filter-chip js-filter">申诉 <span class="filter-chip-count">3</span></div>
              <div class="filter-divider"></div>
              <div class="filter-chip js-filter">已回复 <span class="filter-chip-count">5</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="card mt-4" style="padding: 0;">
              <div class="list-item" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; padding: var(--space-4);">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                  <span class="badge badge-accent">建议</span>
                  <span class="fw-medium">学习中心增加 ESG 投资分析模块</span>
                  <span class="badge badge-success badge-sm" style="margin-left:auto;">已采纳</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-sm text-ink-2">平台回复：感谢建议，已纳入 2026 Q4 课程计划。</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-ink-3 mt-2">2026-06-15 提交 · 2026-07-08 采纳 · +5 PB</div>
              </div>
              <div class="list-item" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; padding: var(--space-4); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                  <span class="badge badge-warn">投诉</span>
                  <span class="fw-medium">EMP 张明 · 会议迟到 30 分钟</span>
                  <span class="badge badge-success badge-sm" style="margin-left:auto;">已处理</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-sm text-ink-2">平台回复：已与 EMP 张明核实，确认为临时突发。已向您补偿 1 次免费 1v1。</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-ink-3 mt-2">2026-05-22 提交 · 2026-05-25 处理完成</div>
              </div>
              <div class="list-item" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; padding: var(--space-4); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                  <span class="badge badge-danger">申诉</span>
                  <span class="fw-medium">公益资金使用公示内容异议</span>
                  <span class="badge badge-success badge-sm" style="margin-left:auto;">申诉成立</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-sm text-ink-2">平台回复：经独立审计复核，您提出的 2 处公示内容已更正，已发布更新版本。</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-ink-3 mt-2">2026-04-08 提交 · 2026-04-22 处理完成</div>
              </div>
              <div class="list-item" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; padding: var(--space-4); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                  <span class="badge badge-accent">建议</span>
                  <span class="fw-medium">工作台支持自定义 KPI 卡片</span>
                  <span class="badge badge-warn badge-sm" style="margin-left:auto;">处理中</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-sm text-ink-2">平台回复：已记录，纳入 2026 Q3 产品路线图。</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-ink-3 mt-2">2026-03-15 提交 · 2026-08-30 仍在评估</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
  <script src="../js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
